---
config:
  theme: base
  look: classic
  htmlLabels: false
  fontSize: 20
  fontFamily: '-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif'
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant A as Task A
  participant B as Task B
  alt Parallel work, waiting chat
    par Task A
      S->>A: Dispatch
      Note over A: Running
    and Task B
      S->>B: Dispatch
      Note over B: Running
    end
    U->>S: New request
    Note over S: Waiting for both
    A-->>S: Done
    B-->>S: Done
    S->>U: Reply
  else Parallel work, ongoing chat
    S->>A: Dispatch
    S->>B: Dispatch
    par Task A
      Note over A: Running
      A-->>S: Done
    and Task B
      Note over B: Running
      B-->>S: Done
    and New request
      U->>S: New request
      S->>U: Receive and respond
    end
  end
